      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e1",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "This systematic review and meta-analysis included all relevant published studies conducted before April, 2024.",
      "reason": "A literature coverage cut-off (before April 2024) is given, but no explicit date on which each database was last searched is reported; the dates in text_4 (April 22, 2024; February 18, 2026; March 10, 2026) are not clearly linked to search dates."
