      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "Studies that assess MRPs among cancer patients in Ethiopia were obtained from databases including Medline, EMBASE, Scopus, Cumulative Index to the Nursing and Allied Literature (CINAHL) and Cochrane Library.",
